   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Present tense endings in -ere",
     "texto": [
      "Verbs in **-ere** use the following endings: **io -o**, **tu -i**, **lui/lei/Lei -e**, **noi -iamo**, **voi -ete**, **loro -ono**.",
      "Watch the differences from -are verbs: the third-person singular ends in **-e** (**lui prende**, **lei scrive**; not *-a*). The second-person plural ends in **-ete** (**voi prendete**). And the third-person plural ends in **-ono**, with the stress on the stem: **PREN-do-no**, **SCRÍ-vo-no**, **VÉ-do-no**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
